Maintainer: Ubuntu Developers <ubuntu-devel-discuss@lists.ubuntu.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 12)
Standards-Version: 4.4.1

Package: kylin-sane-virtual-backend
Architecture: any
Original-Maintainer: liuyuhui <liuyuhui@kylinos.cn>
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Section: libs
Description: SANE virtual backend for Kylin
 This package provides the SANE virtual backend (shared library) that
 enables support for virtual scanners. It implements the SANE API and
 communicates with the proxy application.

Package: kylin-sane-virtual-backend-app
Architecture: any
Original-Maintainer: liuyuhui <liuyuhui@kylinos.cn>
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Section: libs
Description: Proxy application for Kylin SANE virtual backend
 This package contains the proxy application that works with the
 kylin-sane-virtual-backend to handle scanner communication.
